{"id":"15bb8b3e58ed190f","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-ce-pa-complete.md","title":"c.e. 的 PA 度必为完备度","display":"cor-ce-pa-complete — c.e. 的 PA 度必为完备度","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-ce-pa-complete","aliases":["20-cor-ce-pa-complete"],"display":"cor-ce-pa-complete — c.e. 的 PA 度必为完备度","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 10.3.3 与 Arslanov Theorem 5.4.3 的推论","source_printed_pages":[118,185],"source_pdf_pages":[153,217],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-pa-dnc]]","[[20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees]]","[[20-thm-arslanov]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-ce-pa-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-ce-pa-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ce-pa-complete — c.e. 的 PA 度必为完备度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.3.3 与 Arslanov Theorem 5.4.3 的推论"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>118</span><span>185</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>153</span><span>217</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"26f419e80554b0b9\" href=\"?note=26f419e80554b0b9\" title=\"20-thm-pa-dnc\">20-thm-pa-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"84e66db8dad1fed1\" href=\"?note=84e66db8dad1fed1\" title=\"20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees\">20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d1387be254aae2b\" href=\"?note=1d1387be254aae2b\" title=\"20-thm-arslanov\">20-thm-arslanov</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 c.e.；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\deg_T(A))\">\\(\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\deg_T(A))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"26f419e80554b0b9\" href=\"?note=26f419e80554b0b9\" title=\"20-thm-pa-dnc\">20-thm-pa-dnc</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"84e66db8dad1fed1\" href=\"?note=84e66db8dad1fed1\" title=\"20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees\">20-thm-dnc-fpf-degrees</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1d1387be254aae2b\" href=\"?note=1d1387be254aae2b\" title=\"20-thm-arslanov\">20-thm-arslanov</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ce-pa-complete}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_T\\varnothing\\prime.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ce-pa-complete}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_T\\varnothing\\prime.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PA 度给二值 DNC，当然也给一般 DNC；三向编译得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算全 FPF。Arslanov 的 c.e. 完备性判据于是给结论。证明中 c.e. 指可取一个 c.e. 度代表，而不是任意低于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span> 的 oracle。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.3.3 与 Arslanov Theorem 5.4.3 的推论；印刷页 118, 185；PDF 第 153, 217 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-pa-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"26f419e80554b0b9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","hea